  <data name="Install_Intro_Oem" xml:space="preserve"><value>DriverCompass installs exactly this one driver from the official {0} package:</value></data>
  <data name="Install_Steps_Oem" xml:space="preserve"><value>The package is downloaded from {1} and checked against the checksum from the signed {0} catalog and the {0} signature. It is extracted without running any vendor program; only the signed driver is installed – no extra software or {0} control panel. A restore point is created first, and Windows asks for administrator rights (for this step only). You can undo the installation under "History".</value></data>
